Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:17:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(movie_studio): harden asset version string whitespace
 validation

This commit corrects an issue where whitespace-only asset_version strings bypassed validation. The .strip() method is now correctly invoked to ensure that generated assets are strictly non-empty.
---
 ...tgpt__model_gpt_5_6_sol__task_TASK_0005.py | 12 ++---
 ...tgpt__model_gpt_5_6_sol__task_TASK_0005.py | 48 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

